CORE
main.c
--no-standard-checks
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[main.assertion.1\] .* not reached: FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
A byte update of an object of no bytes changes nothing. Simplifying it used to
build a chain of one with_exprt per byte of the update value (8000), which
overflowed the stack when the chain was compared.
